From: Freebuff <cloud@freebuff.local>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 03:00:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] i18n: add locale runtime, settings and /language switcher
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a dependency-free i18n core (t/tp/Intl formatters, zustand-backed
locale state) plus the ru-RU catalog, persists the user's language in
settings, auto-detects it from the environment on first launch, and exposes
a /language command to switch. English stays at the call site as the
fallback, so any untranslated key keeps rendering English.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
