Wraps the always-visible chrome of the TUI: slash-command descriptions,
the keyboard-shortcut overlay, input-mode labels and placeholders, the
status-line indicators and the chat tree's subscription to locale changes.
Skill descriptions stay in English because they come from project SKILL.md
content, not from our UI copy.

